    {
      "id": "card_64a541575b0a4c7a",
      "title": "Live check: MCP proxy — library_search + link an artifact (draft-only)",
      "spec": {
        "task": "LIVE CHECK (draft-only test card, will be archived). No real maintenance — do NOT change anything on the machine beyond the one file below.\n\nSteps, in order:\n1. Call `library_search` with the query \"disk usage\" and note the titles of the top 3 results.\n2. Wait about six minutes: run `sleep 120` three times, one after another (this proves your tools still work after a long session).\n3. Write a small file `mcp-proxy-live-check.md` in your own workspace containing: the current UTC time, and the 3 titles from step 1.\n4. Call `agentpod_link_artifact` with that file's path, then attach the url it returns to this card with `superpipeline_add_reference`.\n5. Call `library_search` again with \"mcp proxy live check\" and note whether it answered.\n6. Complete the card with `superpipeline_complete`, with a handoff listing: the step-1 titles, the artifact url, whether each tool call succeeded or failed (with any error text).\n"
